# Ignore everything by default.
*

# Keep this ignore file.
!.gitignore

# Track only MainPage2 UI source.
!MainPage2/
MainPage2/*

!MainPage2/index.html
!MainPage2/css/
!MainPage2/css/**
!MainPage2/js/
!MainPage2/js/**
!MainPage2/public/
!MainPage2/public/**
!MainPage2/sections/
!MainPage2/sections/**

# Keep optional project docs for the UI source.
!MainPage2/README.md
!MainPage2/PROJECT_MAP.md
!MainPage2/TODO_REFACTOR.md
!MainPage2/CLEANUP_REPORT.md

# Optional: keep package metadata, but never dependencies/cache/build output.
!MainPage2/bundler/
MainPage2/bundler/*
!MainPage2/bundler/package.json
!MainPage2/bundler/package-lock.json

# Always ignore generated or heavy artifacts.
MainPage2/.parcel-cache/
MainPage2/build/
MainPage2/_unused_review/
MainPage2/bundler/.parcel-cache/
MainPage2/bundler/node_modules/

# Common local/system files.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp

# Editor settings.
.idea/
.vscode/
